flowchart LR
    accTitle: M7 skill sync sequence
    accDescr: One host publishes a skill into signed history; every receiving host runs a fast pass, folds the item, looks up its definition, invokes the owning harness manager, reruns hook approval, journals the result, and arrives at the same skill identity.
    A["1 · Publish<br/>One host"] --> B["2 · Store<br/>Signed commit"]
    B --> C["3 · Fast pass<br/>Every host"]
    C --> D["4 · Fold<br/>Item identity"]
    D --> E["5 · Lookup<br/>Definition"]
    E --> F["6 · Manager<br/>Claude + Codex verb"]
    F --> G["7 · Hooks<br/>Approval rerun"]
    G --> H["8 · Journal<br/>Applied / satisfied / held"]
    H --> I["9 · Arrive<br/>Same skill everywhere"]
